\begin{description}
\item[* name:] RidentformationESTO
\item[* relevant examples:] 
1) \'{e}ste es el director.\\
2) \'{e}sta es la situaci\'{o}n.\\
3) \'{e}stos son los libros.\\
4) \'{e}stas son mis hijas.\\
5) $<$empty$>$ son los directores/las chicas.\\
\ \ \ $<$empty>$ es mi hijo (Eng. It is my son).  
\item[* language:] Spanish
\item[* kind of rule:] M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] Identificationalpropformation
\item[* class:] RC: Identificationalverbpformation 
\item[* date of creation:] 25-MAY-1987 10:56:00  
\item[* author:] Elly van Munster
\item[* copied from:] Jan Odijk
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: 18/4/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Elly van Munster\\
conditions on supertiempo and generic added; plus action for aktionsarts.
\item date: 27/4/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Elly van Munster\\
Complete revision (syncategorematic introduction of \'{e}sta, \'{e}se, etc.)
\item date: 29/5/90\ \ \ \ \ author: Elena Pinillos\\
records input and output with a different BPERSPROKEY;action COPY added.
\item date: 01/06/90\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
Added condition for singular NPVAR in subrule 5;
Added action: PERSPROrec2.forma := nomdebil in subrule 5;
Added subrule 6 for redellos: (redellos) son problemas.
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] To form identificational NPPROPs (with \'{e}st..)
out of a third person NPVAR
that is not going to be substituted by an NP containing a personal pronoun or
the WHPRO {\em qu\'{e}}.
